<title>RUSSIA: TABLE-Russian PPI falls 0.1 pct in July.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Russian PPI falls 0.1 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices fell 0.1 percent in July after rising 0.9 percent in June, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  JUL 97    JUN 97    JUL 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    -0.1	+0.9	+1.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +14.9     +16.5     +42.7</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
